        "kicker": "Run clubs in Mumbai",
        "title": "Run clubs in Mumbai: common questions",
        "items": [
          [
            "Are run clubs in Mumbai free?",
            "Many are. Of the runs this week, 9 are free; paid runs are usually ₹199 to ₹499 and often include coffee or coaching."
          ],
          [
            "Do I need to be fast?",
            "No. Most clubs run in pace groups, including walk-run groups. Each listing says which paces it caters for."
          ],
          [
            "Can I come on my own?",
            "Yes. Most people do. Clubs put you in a group with a lead who introduces you."
          ],
          [
            "Why book a free run?",
            "So the club knows to expect you, and you get the start point and any change of plan before the day."
          ],
          [
            "When are most runs?",
            "Early weekend mornings, with a few weekday evening runs. Filter by weekends above."
          ],
          [
            "How do I start a run club?",
            "List it free on Catch. Take bookings, check runners in and see who keeps coming back."
          ]
